        },
        {
         "id": "9a8dca03",
         "elType": "widget",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "Raised in Nea Moudania, Chalkidiki, with roots in Simantra and Nea Triglia, the doctor began studying at the School of Medicine of the Aristotle University of Thessaloniki in 2008.",
          "text_color": "#2B3445",
          "align": "left",
          "_margin": {
           "unit": "px",
           "top": "0",
           "right": "0",
           "bottom": "14",
           "left": "0",
           "isLinked": false
          },
          "typography_typography": "custom",
          "typography_font_family": "Noto Sans",
          "typography_font_size": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 17
          },
          "typography_font_size_mobile": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 16
          },
          "typography_font_weight": "400",
          "typography_line_height": {
           "unit": "em",
           "size": 1.75
          }
         },
         "elements": [],
         "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
         "id": "43b7a3a6",
         "elType": "widget",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "Graduating in 2014 after six years of study, and following military service as a doctor with the 31st Brigade in Evros, the doctor worked for four years at the General Hospital of Chalkidiki, training in the Internal Medicine Department.",
          "text_color": "#2B3445",
          "align": "left",
          "_margin": {
           "unit": "px",
           "top": "0",
           "right": "0",
           "bottom": "14",
           "left": "0",
           "isLinked": false
          },
          "typography_typography": "custom",
          "typography_font_family": "Noto Sans",
          "typography_font_size": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 17
          },
          "typography_font_size_mobile": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 16
          },
          "typography_font_weight": "400",
          "typography_line_height": {
           "unit": "em",
           "size": 1.75
          }
         },
         "elements": [],
         "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
         "id": "ce9ff57f",
         "elType": "widget",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "Training in Gastroenterology continued at the General Hospital of Thessaloniki “G. Papanikolaou”, where the specialty was completed after four years of training and clinical work in the Gastroenterology Department.",
          "text_color": "#2B3445",
          "align": "left",
          "_margin": {
           "unit": "px",
           "top": "0",
           "right": "0",
           "bottom": "14",
           "left": "0",
           "isLinked": false
          },
          "typography_typography": "custom",
          "typography_font_family": "Noto Sans",
          "typography_font_size": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 17
          },
          "typography_font_size_mobile": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 16
          },
          "typography_font_weight": "400",
          "typography_line_height": {
           "unit": "em",
           "size": 1.75
          }
         },
         "elements": [],
         "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
         "id": "0b1f9163",
         "elType": "widget",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "Postgraduate training in Germany followed, with a specialization in intestinal ultrasound at the Carl Gustav Carus University Hospital in Dresden, further broadening clinical and diagnostic experience.",
          "text_color": "#2B3445",
          "align": "left",
          "_margin": {
           "unit": "px",
           "top": "0",
           "right": "0",
           "bottom": "14",
           "left": "0",
           "isLinked": false
          },
          "typography_typography": "custom",
          "typography_font_family": "Noto Sans",
          "typography_font_size": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 17
          },
          "typography_font_size_mobile": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 16
          },
          "typography_font_weight": "400",
          "typography_line_height": {
           "unit": "em",
           "size": 1.75
          }
         },
         "elements": [],
         "widgetType": "text-editor"
        },
        {
         "id": "bacfb3d0",
         "elType": "widget",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "In 2024 the doctor returned to Chalkidiki, the region where they grew up, with the aim of bringing the experience and knowledge gained over the years back home. With this vision, a modern Gastroenterology – Hepatology Clinic and Endoscopy Center was created in Nea Moudania, focused on the patient, modern medicine and high-quality healthcare services for our community.",
          "text_color": "#2B3445",
          "align": "left",
          "_margin": {
           "unit": "px",
           "top": "0",
           "right": "0",
           "bottom": "14",
           "left": "0",
           "isLinked": false
          },
          "typography_typography": "custom",
          "typography_font_family": "Noto Sans",
          "typography_font_size": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 17
          },
          "typography_font_size_mobile": {
           "unit": "px",
           "size": 16
          },
          "typography_font_weight": "400",
          "typography_line_height": {
           "unit": "em",
           "size": 1.75
          }
         },
         "elements": [],
         "widgetType": "text-editor"
        }
       ],
       "isInner": true
      }
     ],
     "isInner": true
    }
